 "substitutedBy": null,
 "summary": "Directs the commissioner of health to collect and report data on the early intervention program for infants and toddlers with disabilities for the purposes of improving the efficiency, cost, effectiveness and quality of such program.",
 "title": "Directs the commissioner of health to collect and report data on the early intervention program for infants and toddlers with disabilities for the purpose of improving such program",
